WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.833
The wire tests the front and middle levers. Their springs push them back down.

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:04.667
The stump bears on the rear lever first.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:06.208
The stump moves into the rear gate and the wire moves on.

00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:07.417
The middle gate is clear. The front lever still blocks the bolt.

00:00:07.417 --> 00:00:08.250
The stump enters the short notch. The notch ends before the bolt can withdraw.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.875
The pressure tool lets the bolt move forward a little. The stump clears the shallow notch.

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:10.833
The front lever rises until the long gate reaches the stump.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:12.500
The pressure tool carries the stump through the three gates.
